MID_MV11_00: <SH>
MID_MV11_00_m001: How did it feel, to upheave the world?
MID_MV11_00_m002: You have lost your mind, beast. No amount of\nslaughter will slake your unending thirst for blood.
MID_MV11_00_m003: You ignore every rebuke and run wild, continuing\nto abuse the weak and downtrodden.
MID_MV11_00_m004: This mania has driven you to challenge even me.
MID_MV11_00_m005: That was your fatal error.
MID_MV11_00_m006: Now...
MID_MV11_00_m007: I shall carve your body into pieces. I shall\npull out your heart...drain your blood.
MID_MV11_00_m008: Until the flow of time comes to\nan end...you will be sealed.
MID_MV11_00_m009: I shall carry out this execution with my own hands.\nCount this the small mercy that it is.
MID_MV11_00_m010: Begone from us, the Darkest Dark.